# GET /order — step 1b, beside the quote in the same scope: a capability
# this chassis declares is answered here, on the same engine, in cap://'s
# own answer shape — the output under `into`, the facts at `cap.*`, every
# failure at `cap.error`. The two calls run concurrently; each has its own
# frame, and their results cannot collide.
WHEN @src == "http" && @web.req.url.path == "/order"
  WITH input = &object("sku", @web.req.url.query.sku.0),
       into  = "_stock"
  EXEC "cap://stock.check"
